{"yo":{"id":"4bd13d66-9771-4150-aa30-ca3f16bb2915","word":"yo","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"greeting similar to hi","word":"oi"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"interjection similar to hey","word":"ei"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"expression of surprise or excitement","word":"eba"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"expression of surprise or excitement","word":"oba"}],"pos":"intj","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"Yo Paulie! How's it going?","bold_text_offsets":[[0,2]],"type":"example","id":"00e04fae-27ca-467d-b037-50800fd394f1"}],"categories":["English slang","English terms with usage examples"],"links":[["hi","hi#English"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"oi"},{"word":"wotcher"}],"raw_glosses":["(slang) A greeting similar to hi."],"glosses":["A greeting similar to hi."],"tags":["slang"],"id":"18baa17a-cbca-4768-bce2-b82cbfffd313"},{"examples":[{"text":"Yo, check this out!","bold_text_offsets":[[0,2]],"type":"example","id":"3651e2b4-1b14-4be0-ab17-831cfdc81e91"},{"text":"Check this out, yo!","bold_text_offsets":[[16,18]],"type":"example","id":"aa7d6188-7355-4821-b043-302e4327bb0e"}],"categories":["English slang","English terms with usage examples"],"links":[["hey","hey#English"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"ahoy"},{"word":"oi"},{"word":"ahem","source":"Thesaurus:hey"},{"word":"ahoy","source":"Thesaurus:hey"},{"word":"cooee","source":"Thesaurus:hey","tags":["Australia"]},{"word":"hey","source":"Thesaurus:hey"},{"word":"heyo","source":"Thesaurus:hey"},{"word":"hoi","source":"Thesaurus:hey","tags":["Britain"]},{"word":"oi","source":"Thesaurus:hey","tags":["Commonwealth"]},{"word":"oi oi","source":"Thesaurus:hey","tags":["British","slang"]},{"word":"yo","source":"Thesaurus:hey","tags":["slang"]},{"word":"yoohoo","source":"Thesaurus:hey"}],"raw_glosses":["(slang) An interjection similar to hey."],"glosses":["An interjection similar to hey."],"tags":["slang"],"id":"cfe1d5c0-6dc3-427b-a7a6-7e7114a17a11"},{"examples":[{"text":"Yo, that's crazy, but I don't remember asking.","bold_text_offsets":[[0,2]],"type":"example","id":"1464502a-816f-4dc2-b8e8-d7100098ed53"},{"text":"I have quickly acclimated myself to the standard form of greeting on campus: \"Oh hey what’s your name? … Yeah, nice to meet you, what're you studying? … Yo that’s sick!\" A script to recite, nearly verbatim, 10 times a day or more.","ref":"2021 October 2, Mason Cannon, “Don't Feel Pressured To Declare Your Major Right Away”, in Study Breaks:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[153,155]],"id":"06531617-c41d-4a7e-a219-817b8c577175"}],"categories":["English slang","English terms with quotations","English terms with usage examples"],"raw_glosses":["(slang) An expression of surprise or excitement."],"glosses":["An expression of surprise or excitement."],"tags":["slang"],"id":"12675bf4-0ab7-4f95-9f11-f22ab5883f6a"},{"examples":[{"text":"Sergeant: Smith?\nPrivate Smith: Yo!","id":"2dec4d67-6413-4d70-a8f8-01d32a9b2ec5"}],"topics":["government","military","politics","war"],"categories":["English military slang"],"links":[["military","military"],["Present","present"],["Here","here"]],"raw_glosses":["(military slang) Present! Here!"],"glosses":["Present! Here!"],"tags":["slang"],"id":"d36c9511-def7-4b0c-b6e9-75dafed6115e"},{"examples":[{"text":"JESSE: That is messed up, yo.","ref":"2010, \"Kafkaesque\" (Breaking Bad TV series, season 3, episode 9)","id":"75792c09-b6a8-4190-aaa6-4ff7670cd5bf"}],"categories":["African-American Vernacular English"],"raw_glosses":["(chiefly African-American Vernacular) Emphatic conclusion to a statement."],"qualifier":"chiefly African-American Vernacular","glosses":["Emphatic conclusion to a statement."],"id":"12109cb6-412d-415a-842b-b24dd459df9f"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[{"sense":"greeting","word":"hey"},{"word":"hi"},{"tags":["interjection"],"word":"hey"}]}}
